# MediTrack Project Rules

> **Note**: This file has been reorganized into separate category files for better maintainability.
> See [README.md](./README.md) for the complete organization structure.

## Quick Reference

The MediTrack project rules are now organized into the following categories:

- **[Development Environment](./development-environment.mdc)** - Laravel Sail, Docker, CLI commands
- **[UI & Styling](./ui-styling.mdc)** - Shadcn UI, Tailwind, design system
- **[Page Patterns](./page-patterns.mdc)** - Layout templates, form structures
- **[Code Quality](./code-quality.mdc)** - Best practices, bug fixing, reasoning

## All Rules Are Active

All rules in the category files are automatically applied by Cursor. This organization improves:

- **Maintainability**: Easier to update specific rule categories
- **Clarity**: Rules are grouped by purpose and context
- **Scalability**: New categories can be added as the project grows
- **Navigation**: Faster to find relevant rules for specific tasks

Please refer to the specific category files for detailed rules and examples.
